 "finding": "Empirical: the Wave pattern repeats every 90 Phase units (unitsText says degrees). In lab/stroke-wave, phase 0, 90 and 180 render pixel-identically for every units/amount pair. Here the pattern shift is about wavelength*phase/90: 1 -> ~1 px, 1.5 -> ~2 px, 30 -> ~33 px, 45 -> ~50 px (half the 100 px wavelength). Sign of the shift not verified. -0.25 and 0.25 both differ from 0 by under 1 px (antialiasing only)."
